      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>This is what happened: [Barak\u0101t, the son of Mr. Joseph]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>known as al-Lebdi\u2014may he rest in Eden!\u2014[appeared in court] and said to us: \u201cBe witness to my declaration, write it down</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[and hand it over to Mrs. X, the widow of]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>the elder Mr. Joseph\u2014may he rest in Eden!, so that it should be in her hand as a legal proof</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>that I have made this declaration while in good health, etc\u2026</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>\u2026</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>\u2026</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>I have given her a power of attorney over all [. . .]</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
